WEBVTT

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:10.590
Why won't Father come to see me?

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:14.680
He cares more about his
job than me, the runt.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:16.940
Father...

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:53.090
At Café Mitter Meyer

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:52.240
<i>Going out to town is best
when looking for books.</i>

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:56.040
<i>I found useful books for creating materials
for the princes' lessons, too.</i>

00:01:57.660 --> 00:01:59.500
Café Mitter Meyer?

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:02.640
A café with a nice atmosphere
in this back alley...

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:04.510
Pardon me.

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:05.410
Coming!

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:06.090
Welcome, good...

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:07.350
sir...

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:10.270
Prince Licht?

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.600
Our menu, sir.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.610
My apologies for the mix-up.

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:24.830
Not at all. I get it all the time.

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:28.240
Though I don't know how a commoner like
me could be mistaken for a prince!

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:32.810
When you think about it,
you'd never find a prince working in a café.

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:34.800
Indeed you would not. Ahem...

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.250
What would you recommend?

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:39.920
Our most popular offering
is the einspänner.

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:42.680
I personally prefer the kapuziner.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.550
We add freshly-whipped milk
and cream to coffee...

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:47.680
Twinkle.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:52.050
Then we top it off with our unique
arrangement of cocoa powder and orange peel.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:53.310
Twinkle, twinkle.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:59.600
The citrus goes perfectly with the
chocolate and caramel in a Dobos torte.

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:00.980
Twinkle.

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:03.880
A kapuziner and a Dobos torte, please.

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:05.360
Coming right up.

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:10.750
I normally don't eat sweets,
yet he made it sound irresistible.

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:14.250
He has the same way with
words as Prince Licht.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:18.020
But his serious nature is
completely unlike the prince.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:29.140
Badum Badum Badum Badum

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:26.130
What is the professor doing here?!

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:29.140
I did manage to fool him, right?

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:33.020
If word gets out that I'm
working on the sly...

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.750
Licht, you lied about always having fun?

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:38.770
Too serious... Not cool...

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:42.110
Ew. He pretended to be a party boy,
but he's serious?

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:42.890
How dull.

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:44.370
Licht's too serious.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:45.520
Licht is dull.

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.160
Licht isn't cool.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.240
No!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:51.240
I-I'd be lucky to get off with just that.

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:54.140
I'm doing something
unacceptable for a royal.

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:56.740
If Father found out,

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:58.870
I wouldn't just be stripped
of my claim to the throne,

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.770
I'd be disowned and kicked
out of the palace!

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:07.950
It's all okay. If the professor
doesn't find out, no one else will.

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:10.440
All I have to do is not act like me.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:11.800
Hello!

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:15.180
Oh, Richard! We came as soon
as we heard you were working.

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.520
Let's chat our hearts out.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:21.440
Wow, really? I'll give you lovely
ladies lots of attention.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:25.450
Stare.

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:28.380
Don't act like me. Don't act like me.
Don't act like me.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:31.720
What's gotten into you,
Richie? You're on task today.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:32.450
Sir!

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:38.280
S-Say, could someone else wait on
that little fellow with the glasses?

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:38.960
Huh?

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:40.720
Oh, he's too precious!

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:43.200
Alone at a café? Now that's a dapper boy.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:44.970
Poor Professor.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.100
No can do, I'm afraid.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:48.340
What?

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:53.340
A professional waiter takes complete care of
their section, from the order to the check.

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:57.780
Do you know what would happen if
we started pulling switcheroos?

00:04:57.780 --> 00:04:59.730
The patrons would be confused.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.290
Is something off about our Richie today?

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:04.130
He's always been a strange one, but still.

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.280
Don't say it so bluntly.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:11.120
Maybe he'll leave as soon
as he finishes eating.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.780
Here you are, sir.

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:16.380
It looks delicious.
I'm glad I took your recommendation.

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:33.420
He started reading! He's here for
the long haul! Professor, you jerk!

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:35.640
<i>Why did he have to have a book?!</i>

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.640
I knew it. Something's off with him today.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:42.600
I guess I'll stay as far away as
I can and try not to stand out.

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:45.500
You just moved that ball!

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:48.530
Don't go making things up
because you're losing.

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:50.610
You know, you've always been...

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:52.980
Look out!

00:05:57.600 --> 00:05:59.170
Are you hurt, miss?

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.640
N-No... I'm fine.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.320
I'm sorry!

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:04.540
I can't apologize enough.

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:07.250
If he hadn't been cheating...

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:08.410
Excuse me?!

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:09.170
What?!

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.720
The space between the wall and
the table's a tad too narrow.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.510
I'm sure it was an accident.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:18.140
I'm terribly sorry. I'll speak
to the owner about this.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.130
And...

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:31.400
We'll say it's my win today.

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:39.240
Look at you go. And here I thought
you were acting funny today.

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:44.880
Check, please.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.040
Y-Yes, sir.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.720
That was an excellent job.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:53.170
Not only did you deal with the trouble handily,
you preserved the café's atmosphere.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:56.470
Oh, no, you're flattering me, sir.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:02.380
This is a splendid café. I will come again.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:05.770
Thank you. We'll be waiting.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:08.340
Actually, I'd rather you didn't.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:11.030
Well, at least I managed to fool him.

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:13.320
What's this?

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:16.130
Dear Prince Licht,

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:18.730
When you return home, see me in my room.

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:19.330
Heine.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:21.420
Th-The jig's up...

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:22.590
No way...

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:24.680
Check, please.

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:26.160
R-Right away, sir.

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:29.330
I'm here to bring you home.

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:32.550
Your father is waiting
for you, Prince Licht.

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:34.480
You're...

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:43.900
If Viktor finds out that Prince
Licht is working in town,

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:45.560
the prince's position will be in peril.

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:49.410
I should speak with His Highness
one-on-one, and then...

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.340
Prince Licht?

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.750
Prince Licht... Don't tell me—

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:18.840
His Highness comes first.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:21.920
Your Majesty, may I enter?

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:24.560
Is that the royal tutor? Let him in.

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:28.900
P-Professor...

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:32.270
Did you know about this?

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:35.790
I intended to discuss it today.

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:40.940
I see. Well, I have already heard
everything from Count Rosenberg.

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:44.610
So that man was Count Rosenberg...

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.450
I cannot believe you were doing this.

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:49.610
Even considering your usual games,
this is too much.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.740
If I may, Your Majesty...

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:56.350
His Highness was quite serious
as he worked. This is no game.

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:59.240
I believe that the prince's thoughts
should be considered here.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:01.930
Oh? Explain yourself, Licht.

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:04.810
It was a game at first.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:10.510
The ladies would talk about handsome waiters,
and I thought I could do it, too.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.440
But when I tried, I messed it all up.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.270
But everyone taught me so patiently,
and thanks to them,

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:19.610
I learned the job and took
a real interest in it.

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:21.960
I won't quit.

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:24.060
It feels worthwhile.

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:27.340
I don't care what anyone says.
I'm staying on.

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:30.380
I certainly cannot allow that.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:33.500
Why not? Isn't it enough
that I want to do it?

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:35.570
That is not the problem.

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:41.460
You're guaranteed a minimum of safety at
the noble-exclusive halls you frequent.

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:45.510
If your identity as prince is revealed...
No, even if it remains a secret.

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:48.730
If danger befalls you in this café,
I won't be able to protect you.

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:51.140
Listen to me.

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:54.040
You need to be more aware
of your place as a royal.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:57.330
If anything were to happen,
it would jeopardize the royal line.

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:00.190
Licht—

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:01.420
Do you remember?

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:07.050
When I was little and sickly,
you never came to visit me.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:11.950
You didn't care about a fifth prince
who could never become king, did you?

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:15.550
Now you want to play the good father
and talk about protecting me?

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:18.350
What you really want to protect
is the royal family's reputation.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:23.220
You never even try to understand me!

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:26.510
Licht, calm down. Let's talk about this.

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:29.800
Forget it. I don't care!

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:30.300
Licht!

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:32.220
Prince Licht...

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:47.240
I ran away without a plan. What now?

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:50.910
I could stay with a girl...

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:53.920
No, they're all friends
of some noble or another.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.880
I can only count on one place.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:00.880
One of them might let me stay
over for a little while.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:03.540
I'll ask when our work is done.

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:06.950
I'll work at the café and
support myself with that money.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:08.850
Wouldn't be a bad life...

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:10.510
Wait!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:15.140
Father? Professor?

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:21.490
Let us return to the palace
and discuss this calmly.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:24.000
No. There's nothing to say.

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:26.610
I'm going back to work. Step aside.

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:28.440
Do you mean to...

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:32.030
If you're going to be this stubborn,
I have my own plan.

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:33.250
A plan?

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:34.850
Wh-What are you going to do?

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:38.450
Richie! Where have you been?
I was looking for you.

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:39.090
Huh?

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:40.650
Who is this?

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:43.840
A pleasure to meet you. I am his father.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:47.930
I'm the owner of this café.
Your son's a big help.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.400
The owner? Excellent.

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.520
I have something to ask you.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.970
No! He's going to force me to quit?

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:56.640
Wh—no! You can't!

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:57.140
Don't—

00:11:57.410 --> 00:12:01.150
Would you allow me to work
here for a short time?

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:03.400
Huh?

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:07.030
U-Uh...

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:11.820
A few hours is enough.
Won't you allow me to work here?

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:15.270
Wh-What is he saying? A king, working here?

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:17.330
Viktor, what are you doing?

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:21.640
I cannot understand why my
son wishes to work here.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:25.920
I want to truly understand his
heart by working here myself.

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:28.650
H-Hold on! Are you crazy?

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:31.830
You said I never try to understand you, no?

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:34.010
I did, but...

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:39.640
D-Do not be so demanding. Look.
You've put the owner on the spot.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:42.150
Sad

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:46.610
All right. For the five
hours until closing time,

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:47.820
you're hired.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.320
Owner!

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:52.970
What a good, loving father.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:55.330
I can't turn down those sincere eyes.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:58.040
Let's get you into uniform.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.540
Many thanks.

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:03.170
You look familiar. But who was it...

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.050
This middle-aged madman...

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:06.940
This has gotten way out of control.

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:09.260
What the heck is he thinking?

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:11.880
The king is working... The king is working?!

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:15.480
But he could never do café work.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:19.170
The owner will kick him out
when he gets in the way. Mmhmm!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:21.290
I'm ready.

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:28.810
How do I look?

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:30.580
Not strange, I hope.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.600
H-He looks like he's perfect for the job.

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:34.060
You look handsome.

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:35.120
It's perfect on you.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:39.390
He's older than he looks, you know!

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:41.420
I'm glad it doesn't look strange.

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:44.790
What do you think, Heine?

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:46.390
Slurp.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:46.380
Slurp

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:47.600
Heine!

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:47.760
Slurp

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:48.370
Snub.

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:50.130
Heine?

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:50.890
Snub, snub, snub.

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:56.190
I would not have shown you this place
if I'd known you would be this reckless.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:59.390
Weren't you going to
bring His Highness home?

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:03.310
Yes, but I need to understand Licht's
feelings if I want to persuade him.

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:06.200
Besides, this brings back memories.

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:08.940
You are not the same boy you were back then.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:12.530
Yes, things are different now.
For both of us.

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:17.160
Goodness gracious. I will write my
lesson materials while I wait here.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.940
May I leave Prince Licht to you?

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:22.300
But of course.

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:27.040
Like father, like son, I suppose.

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:30.270
Viktor has always flabbergasted me.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.230
This is a matter between father and son.

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:34.690
As a tutor, I can only watch over them.

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:38.100
Okay, Richie, show your father what to do.

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:39.470
Why me?!

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:40.770
I'm counting on you.

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:44.500
But we were fighting mere
moments ago. What do I say?

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:46.480
Wait, all I have to do is
give him basic instructions.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.650
It took me months to get
comfortable with this job.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:50.000
He can't pick it up in one night.

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:51.460
Excuse me!

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:54.240
You're up. Take her order.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.060
All right.

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:57.190
The sooner he messes up,
the sooner he'll leave.

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:02.340
My humble apologies for the wait.

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:06.350
Your every wish is my command.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.970
One franziskaner and one
linzertorte, please.

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.420
As you wish, madam.

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:18.180
I did as my attendants do. How was I?

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:21.790
W-Well, I think the kneeling was a bit much.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:24.250
I'll keep that in mind next time.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:27.750
A-Any old adult could take an order.

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:33.050
But good customer service is all
about rapport with patrons.

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:34.600
Father could never do it.

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:36.640
E-Er...

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:38.000
Is something the matter?

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:41.110
This patron is from abroad...

00:15:41.110 --> 00:15:43.250
F-Father, don't...

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:45.880
Puis-je vous aider?

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.380
Ou est la gare?

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:49.810
Gape...

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:49.800
Je vais vous dessiner un plan.

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:52.560
He needed directions to the station.

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.180
That was incredible, sir!

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:57.990
Not at all. I meet with many
foreigners in my work.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:02.060
Father is fluent in foreign
languages? Wow...

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:04.900
Wait. So what? He just got lucky.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:09.980
With my perfect smile and polished
conversation skills, everyone loves me.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:12.150
Father could never be like me.

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:15.250
Oh, my! You have the smile of an angel.

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:16.270
Thank you.

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:18.350
That novel...

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:20.980
It's an old book. Have you ever read it?

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:23.670
Actually, I love it.
Particularly the main character.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:24.700
What? What?

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:25.810
He's too cool.

00:16:25.810 --> 00:16:27.740
Excuse me, I'm ready to order!

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:28.970
What's your name, dear?

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:30.710
Won't you marry my daughter?

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:31.710
No, marry mine!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.650
Will you be my grandchild?

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:35.890
Incredible. Just incredible!

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.220
He hasn't made a single mistake,

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:38.970
and he's become the café's most
popular waiter in a single night!

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:40.670
I-I lost...

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:45.000
I never knew that Father
could do so many things.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:47.190
The Father I know...

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:50.950
is a workaholic who never came
to see me when I was sick...

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:54.940
an annoyance who turns all clingy on
the rare occasion that we see him...

00:16:56.940 --> 00:17:00.320
Can he pull off his first time
doing a new job this smoothly

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:03.770
because he's done so many things as king?

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:08.760
I always told myself that I didn't want
to be like him when I grow up, but...

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:14.660
Always so helpful.

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:18.250
It's no problem. Let me hear
more of your old stories.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:19.420
You betcha.

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:23.390
Sir!

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:25.750
Won't you keep working with us?

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:27.740
Even if it's not for long!

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:30.690
We and the patrons would all
be thrilled. Pretty please?

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:32.940
Thank you, but I'm afraid I can't.

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:35.000
Please give it positive consideration!

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:38.740
I'll bring in the signs.

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:41.280
Wait.

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:43.230
I'll help you.

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:43.920
Huh?

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:49.840
Licht. I'm sorry.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:51.040
Huh?

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:54.120
For forcing myself into your café.

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:56.330
For all the pain I've put you through.

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:59.170
I should have explained
myself better, earlier.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:03.140
If you were to be gravely injured
outside of the palace...

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:07.160
If your job led to a scandal...

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:09.720
It could hurt your claim to the throne.

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:14.720
I was only worried that you weren't
prepared for that possibility.

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:19.360
It has nothing to do with my
reputation or the royal line.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.570
I won't force my way on you.

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:26.920
Whether you work or quit is up to you.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:28.580
Father...

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:31.270
I love this café.

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:34.760
Working out here is far more fun
than being cooped up in the palace.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:36.250
But...

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:40.760
It would feel wrong to keep
working if it worries you.

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:42.780
Licht...

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:46.470
I guess I didn't understand you.

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:49.010
I never thought about how
demanding your job must be.

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:51.890
I couldn't get over how you didn't
come to see me when I was sick.

00:18:51.890 --> 00:18:54.590
But of course you couldn't
put your children first.

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:59.020
A king has a duty to his
kingdom and his people.

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:00.560
It's more than that.

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:00.990
Huh?

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:03.280
It is for the kingdom...

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:09.290
and for my children, who are more
precious to me than anything.

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:12.750
Father...

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:19.450
I'm sorry that I didn't know
how much I'd hurt you.

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:21.590
I am truly sorry, Licht.

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:26.120
Truly a man of integrity,
both as a king and a father.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:29.690
I would expect no less of the
first person I was able to trust.

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:33.630
I have to tell the owner
that I can't work anymore.

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:36.140
I'll miss it here...

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:38.610
Prince Licht.

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:40.920
I have a lesson for you.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:42.130
Huh?

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:46.950
Before quitting something you want to do,
you should explore alternative solutions.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:47.820
Huh?

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:50.800
My work went more efficiently than expected.

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:54.080
I've decided to visit the café every week.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:58.210
How would you feel about
working when I am here?

00:19:58.210 --> 00:19:59.000
Huh?

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.900
If anything happens, I can protect you.

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:03.720
I wouldn't worry then.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:07.600
I learned many things in the last few hours.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:09.950
This is an excellent
addition to your studies.

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:12.180
If you'd like to stay on, then you should.

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:15.550
Your Majesty! Everyone's waiting for you!

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:19.310
You promised you'd be back in time for the
meeting when we let you through the gates.

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:21.430
My apologies. I need my clothes...

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:22.810
You can change at the palace!

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:25.400
A carriage will be around for His
Highness and the royal tutor shortly.

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:28.680
Goodbye, Licht. Give the owner
and the rest my apologies.

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:31.750
Royal Tutor, I leave Licht in your hands.

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:35.070
Kings really are busy...

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:39.900
All jobs are hard work to
some degree. You would know.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:41.470
I guess so!

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:46.970
But... maybe I wouldn't mind being king,
if I could be like Father.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:51.620
So I'll do my best with your
lessons from now on, too.

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:54.020
Oh, but I won't be quitting the café.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:56.970
I wouldn't want to make my fangirls cry.

00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:57.850
Stare.

00:20:57.850 --> 00:20:59.140
Wh-What?

00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:03.780
Perhaps I misjudged you.

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:07.740
To be frank, I thought you the
most mysterious of the princes...

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:12.410
But in truth, you are a strikingly
ordinary boy, aren't you?

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:16.460
You might be mature for your age,
but you'll always be the youngest.

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.830
Rebelling against your father
is typical of your age...

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:19.660
Stop!

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:22.810
What part of this devastatingly hot,
charismatic prince makes you think that?

00:21:23.240 --> 00:21:24.260
Jeez, you joker.

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:26.340
You needn't push yourself to play the fool.

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:27.720
I know you're serious at heart.

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:31.410
No! Don't look at me with
that indifferent stare!

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:32.290
Richie!

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:33.760
Coming!

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:36.590
Professor!

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:38.760
Thank you.

00:21:44.090 --> 00:21:49.950
Now, why did Count Rosenberg know
that Prince Licht was working here?

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:52.080
What a pity.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:55.500
Here I hoped one of the candidates for
the throne would drop out of the race.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.860
Oh, well. I wasn't expecting much.

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:01.960
I'm sure I'll find plenty of
scandals if I look for them.

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:06.100
Now, who to ruin first?

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:41.460
Leo, what kind of coffee do you like?

00:23:41.460 --> 00:23:44.030
I like the Café Klaus blend.

00:23:44.030 --> 00:23:46.860
The best way to bring out the aroma is—

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:48.080
Wait, wait, wait!

00:23:47.150 --> 00:23:53.730
Next Time:

00:23:47.150 --> 00:23:53.730
The Whereabouts of a Dream

00:23:48.080 --> 00:23:49.710
Next time, "The Whereabouts of a Dream."

00:23:49.710 --> 00:23:52.100
If you say too many difficult
things at once I get dizzy.

00:23:52.100 --> 00:23:53.890
Don't tell me it burned out your brain!
